@startuml
[*] --> SearchInitiated
SearchInitiated --> SearchProcessing : User initiates search
SearchProcessing --> FiltersApplied : User applies filters
SearchProcessing --> TopFeaturesDisplayed : No filters applied
FiltersApplied --> ResultsFiltering : System processes filters
ResultsFiltering --> TopFeaturesDisplayed : Display filtered results
TopFeaturesDisplayed --> [*] : Search completed
@enduml
